{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Hell Yeah!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotten Survivor is a 2D top-down shooter with roguelike elements where you fight hordes of enemies using a huge variety of weapons and modifiers. Be free to create crazy synergies and combinations to become stronger every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ Different modifiers (upgrades)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing a round grants you the chance of choosing a modifier! Modifiers are stackable upgrades that can change the way you play the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akimbo!<br>Dual wield any of the 30+ different weapons, creating wacky weapon combinations that fit your play-style perfectly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend your arena!<br>Use credits to unlock different parts of the stage to get access to more weapons and resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve!<br>Unlock stronger modifiers and weapons by earning XP from every run you make!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655290?t=1759779686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/285f2c42f64630740eb632730b685d072b7c5911/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759779686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/3c43ad83db5cd42922ebf96c53b530456e9e5945/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759779686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/3c43ad83db5cd42922ebf96c53b530456e9e5945/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759779686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3672310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Hell Yeah!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotten Survivor is a 2D top-down shooter with roguelike elements where you fight hordes of enemies using a huge variety of weapons and modifiers. Be free to create crazy synergies and combinations to become stronger every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ Different modifiers (upgrades)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing a round grants you the chance of choosing a modifier! Modifiers are stackable upgrades that can change the way you play the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akimbo!<br>Dual wield any of the 30+ different weapons, creating wacky weapon combinations that fit your play-style perfectly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend your arena!<br>Use credits to unlock different parts of the stage to get access to more weapons and resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve!<br>Unlock stronger modifiers and weapons by earning XP from every run you make!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Inventario"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/03daacd0a4de79d51f0b3967922b9e817ad85394/header.jpg?t=1759779686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3655290/932521333/500548169cae6bee1b269c1e27d4c7754bbf00f9/1755791543/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755809988","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3655290/932521333/500548169cae6bee1b269c1e27d4c7754bbf00f9/1755791543/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755809988","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3655290/932521333/500548169cae6bee1b269c1e27d4c7754bbf00f9/1755791